  (text "19-wire wheel harness: J8.N to J9.N (17 wires).\nPins 1 and 17 are shared GND; pin 16 is +3V3.\nPower J10/J11: 1 ACT_5V, 2 GND. Three shared grounds total."
    (at 20 22 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "d7493ec3-8853-5534-8f81-becb3cd7f216"))
  (text "U22 raw RUN/PWM inputs default low locally. R77 remains on main.\nCS inputs default low only when disconnected; clocks also low and RUN disabled.\nR88 is 4.7k in this project to support the main-side fault pulldown.\nNo power is carried across breakaway tabs. Do not hot plug."
    (at 20 238 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "00c5c81b-87b2-5550-94cf-cdccfc8a4693"))
